Fedora RPM package of [Cosmalia](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}})
`{{TAG}}`: the opinionated XDG session (launcher, session entry and
systemd user units) for cosmic-comp-traffic + Noctalia.

### Install

```sh
gh release download {{TAG}} -R {{REPOSITORY}} -p '*.rpm' -D /tmp/cosmalia-session
cd /tmp/cosmalia-session && sha256sum -c ./*.rpm.sha256
sudo dnf install ./cosmalia-session-*.noarch.rpm
```

The package does not change the greeter default. To make it selectable
in a gtkgreet dropdown without changing the default:

```sh
sudo cosmalia-session-default --list
```

Then, optionally, make it the greeter default:

```sh
sudo cosmalia-session-default
```

Needs `cosmic-comp` (provided by cosmic-comp-traffic), `noctalia`,
`cosmic-settings`, `cosmic-settings-daemon`, `cosmic-screenshot`,
`xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic`, `xdg-desktop-portal-wlr`,
`xdg-desktop-portal-gnome`, `polkit`, `gnome-keyring` and
`wireplumber`. The package replaces the old
`cosmic-comp-traffic-session` package.

### Revert

```sh
sudo dnf remove cosmalia-session
```